  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Buffalo Ridge is Phoenix's rugged mountain-adjacent course — elevation, blind holes, and great views across a long 18 alongside the mountain, plus the newer Alpha-9 loop for 27 holes total at par 81. It's the course where Phoenix players go for a workout with a view.",
    "Free to play with mixed tees and Mach 2 baskets, with restrooms on site. The terrain is rough and real — this is desert disc golf at its most honest, with the mountain always watching.",
    "The blind holes are the signature experience: you throw, you hike, you find out. Bring water and sturdy shoes."
  ],

